# Keyboard shortcuts

Sources: `packages/web/src/shared/lib/shortcuts.ts` and `packages/web/src/shared/lib/navigation-history.ts`.

- Reuse the shortcut registry/hooks and platform-aware formatting. Inspect the current catalog before assigning a combination.
- Scope screen-specific actions to the correct context and enabled state. Preserve editable-input guards and modal precedence.
- Use `mod` semantics instead of hardcoding Cmd/Ctrl. Do not override standard editing or browser shortcuts casually.
- Ensure keyboard actions call the same domain operation as their visible controls; avoid duplicate navigation/store logic.
- Update help labels when a shortcut changes and release registrations with their owner.
